OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over energy theft as city
OL,4,Atops national list
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople tampering with electricity and
OL,7,Fgas meters are "putting lives at risk",
OL,8,Faccording to Crimestoppers.
OL,10,FThe charity has launched its Unknown
OL,11,FDanger campaign to highlight the
OL,12,Fdangers of energy theft and encourage
OL,13,Fpeople to report it in the West
OL,14,FMidlands.
OL,16,FAccording to data obtained by
OL,17,FCrimestoppers, the Birmingham postcode
OL,18,Frecorded 1,008 confirmed gas and
OL,19,Felectricity thefts in 2025-26, the
OL,20,Fhighest total in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
